# Progress Tracking

Track module/lab completion.

Formats: `progress.csv`, `progress.json`, or `progress.md`

Example `progress.csv`:
```csv
course,module,topic,status,date,notes
ITN,1,Network Fundamentals,done,2026-10-10,
ITN,2,Basic Switch Config,in_progress,2026-10-10,
SRWE,3,VLANs & Trunking,pending,, 
```